WEBVTT

00:00:28.254 --> 00:00:32.229
in how the world should
think about introverts.

00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:35.797
She published a best-selling
book called "Quiet,"

00:00:35.821 --> 00:00:39.620
and she also gave a TED Talk:
"The Power of Introverts."

00:00:39.644 --> 00:00:42.543
The book and the talk
were packed with ideas

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:45.964
on how to avoid doing
what we often do to introverts:

00:00:45.988 --> 00:00:49.405
make them suffer
and ignore their superpowers.

00:00:49.429 --> 00:00:52.283
(Recorded talk) Susan Cain:
...and it's our loss, for sure.

00:00:52.307 --> 00:00:55.240
But it is also our colleagues' loss
and our communities' loss.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:58.223
And at the risk of sounding grandiose,
it is the world's loss,

00:00:58.247 --> 00:01:00.819
because when it comes
to creativity and to leadership,